{"3870780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nekurogahara: Psycho Ronins", "steam_appid": 3870780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game made by a single person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanics are very experimental even though it looks like a generic soulslike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be confused about everything, not sure what's going on and even think the game's broken - it's ok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not industry standard in any way, so you will often feel confused and scared of pressing buttons or choosing options, until you've spent some time with the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is coded on purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're new to action/fighting games I'd recommend playing other hyper-active games before playing Nekurogahara.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't even read the name of the game without stuttering, so imagine what this game will do to your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/2c8c19b2dff9c15f85247f6f5f04034e.poster.avif?t=1787907389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/2c8c19b2dff9c15f85247f6f5f04034e.webm?t=1787907389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/2c8c19b2dff9c15f85247f6f5f04034e.mp4?t=1787907389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game made by a single person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanics are very experimental even though it looks like a generic soulslike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be confused about everything, not sure what's going on and even think the game's broken - it's ok.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not industry standard in any way, so you will often feel confused and scared of pressing buttons or choosing options, until you've spent some time with the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is coded on purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >///</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're new to action/fighting games I'd recommend playing other hyper-active games before playing Nekurogahara.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't even read the name of the game without stuttering, so imagine what this game will do to your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/2c8c19b2dff9c15f85247f6f5f04034e.poster.avif?t=1787907389\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/2c8c19b2dff9c15f85247f6f5f04034e.webm?t=1787907389\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/extras/2c8c19b2dff9c15f85247f6f5f04034e.mp4?t=1787907389\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "First episode in the series.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/4d78fb381d80a7d63d6b2c2a6749983e4b43af05/header.jpg?t=1787907389", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870780/933abb979732d4c588889f40d266e79ee8b5be72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787